Electron adaptation notes (44-x-y):
inspect_tools.h: on this branch PausedInDebuggerTool::v8_session_ was a
plain v8_inspector::V8InspectorSession* (upstream's pre-image was a
raw_ptr<> with DanglingUntriaged); it is replaced by V8SessionHolder
exactly as upstream does. V8SessionHolder already exists on this branch.

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/inspector/inspect_tools.cc b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/inspector/inspect_tools.cc
